{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/sec-physical-elaborations-intro","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Prose","doco:Section"],"label":"sec:physical-elaborations-intro","kind":"prose","text":"physical-elaborations-intro.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"sec:physical-elaborations-intro\"></a><p>The deformed operators carry direct physical readings. We extract the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-torsion leaves, the properties of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-harmonic forms, the linearisation conventions, and the Schrödinger equation on the jet coaction.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/physical-elaborations-intro.md","heading":""}
